{"type":"message","id":"800849c9","parentId":"891a58bb","timestamp":"2026-04-09T07:20:52.045Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52417a0574a0ee827dbfd861366\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-09 07:20 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b52417a0574a0ee827dbfd861366]\n听风: 可实现性如何"}],"timestamp":1775719252036}}
